{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16592","headline":"题段上人院壁画古松 · 朱湾","name":"题段上人院壁画古松","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"石上盘古根，谓言天生有。\n安知草木性，变在画师手。\n阴深方丈间，直趣幽且闲。\n木纹离披势搓捽，中裂空心火烧出。\n扫成三寸五寸枝，便是千年万年物。\n莓苔浓淡色不同，一面死皮生蠹虫。\n风霜未必来到此，气色杳在寒山中。\n孤标可玩不可取，能使支公道场古。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"朱湾","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_16592.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16592","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}